SUMMARY:Easy Run + Relaxed Strides
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3400 kcal\, 165 g protein\, 485 g carbs\, 9
 5 g fat\nMacro timing: 30-60 g carbs 60-120 min before running\, then 25-
 35 g protein plus carbs after.\nCategory: easy_run\nRun volume: 6 km\n\n\
 nWarm-Up:\n- 5-10 min easy movement\, joint prep\, and 2-3 gradual ramp s
 ets before loading.\n\n\nMain Work:\n- Easy run RPE 3-4: 6 km conversatio
 nal.\n- Strides: 4 x 15 sec relaxed at RPE 6 on flat ground only if knees
  feel normal.\n\n\nRun:\n- Planned running volume: 6 km.\n\n\nFueling:\n-
  small carb snack before morning running if sleep was poor.\n\n\nRecovery
 :\n- 8 min calves\, quads\, glutes\, and ankles.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
