 er press 3 x 8-10 at RPE 8.\n- Lat pull-down or pull-ups: 3 x 8-12 at RPE
  8 paired with incline dumbbell press 2-3 x 8-12 at RPE 8.\n- Shoulder an
 d upper back finisher: lateral raises 3 x 15-20\, rear delt fly or revers
 e pec-deck 3 x 15-20\, face pulls 2 x 12-15\, and dumbbell rotator cuff w
 ork.\n- Easy run RPE 3-4: 3-4 km conversational only if legs feel normal\
 ; otherwise walk 20-30 min.\n\n\nRun:\n- Planned running volume: 4 km.\n\
 n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein near target\, and place ca
 rbohydrates before and after training.\n\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window sta
 ys 22:00-06:00\; add mobility if joints feel stiff.\n\n\nProgression & Gu
 ardrails:\n- Progression: double progression\; add reps before load and k
 eep the whole session capped around RPE 8.
