SUMMARY:Core + Chest/Back Strength Capacity
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3350 kcal\, 175 g protein\, 455 g carbs\, 9
 5 g fat\nMacro timing: 35-45 g protein in 4 meals\, 40-70 g carbs before 
 lifting\, and a protein-plus-carb meal after training.\nCategory: gym\nRu
 n volume: 0 km\n\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5 min easy bike\, shoulder prep\, thoraci
 c mobility\, hip openers\, and two light press/row ramp sets.\n\n\nMain W
 ork:\n- Chest volume: bench press 3 x 6-8\, incline dumbbell press 3 x 8-
 10\, dumbbell press 2 x 8-10\, pec-deck 2 x 12-15\, dips 2 x 6-10\, and p
 ush-ups 2 x clean reps.\n- Back volume: lat pulldown or pull-ups 3 x 8-12
 \, cable row or chest-supported row 3 x 8-12\, face pulls 2 x 12-15\, and
  rear delt fly or reverse pec-deck 2 x 15-20.\n- Leg maintenance: hip thr
 ust or glute bridge 3 x 8-12\, leg extension 2 x 12-15\, and seated or ly
 ing hamstring curl 2 x 10-15 at RPE 7.\n- Core volume: Pallof press 3 x 1
 0 per side\, side plank 2 x 30 sec per side\, plank variations 2 x 30-45 
 sec\, hanging leg raises 2-3 sets\, weighted sit-ups 2 x 8-12\, and kettl
 ebell side bend or around the head kettlebell 2 x 10.\n\n\nFueling:\n- Hi
 t daily macros\, keep protein near target\, and place carbohydrates befor
 e and after training.\n\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00-06:00\; 
 add mobility if joints feel stiff.\n\n\nProgression & Guardrails:\n- Prog
 ression: this is the eighth strength day in the 14-day wave\; cap work at
  RPE 7-8\, use supersets\, and trim accessories before anchor work if rec
 overy dips.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
