 ec-deck 2 x 10-15\, lateral raises 3 x 15-20\, and rear delt fly 2 x 15-2
 0.\n- Arm and core finisher: tricep pulldown 2 x 10-15 plus hanging leg r
 aises 2-3 sets at RPE 8.\n\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein
