 wings\, A-skips\, ankling\, and 3 relaxed strides.\n\n\nMain Work:\n- Ply
 ometrics: pogos 3 x 20 sec\, snap-downs 3 x 5\, low broad jumps 3 x 3 at 
 crisp RPE 6-7.\n- Hill sprints: 4 x 10-12 sec uphill at sprint RPE 7-8\; 
 full walk-back recovery.\n- Stop the sprint set if mechanics get sloppy o
 r knees feel sharp.\n\n\nOptional:\n- weighted sit-ups 2 x 8-12 and side 
 plank 2 x 30 sec per side.\n\n\nRun:\n- Planned running volume: 3 km.\n\n
 \nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein near target\, and place car
 bohydrates before and after training.\n\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stay
 s 22:00-06:00\; add mobility if joints feel stiff.\n\n\nProgression & Gua
 rdrails:\n- Progression: add sprint reps only when contacts stay snappy a
 nd knees stay quiet the next day\; sprint RPE 7-8\, never max.
